<figure class="record-flow" aria-label="One recorded sequence, read backward for rewind and forward for replay">
  <div class="flow-grid">
    <div class="use rewind"><h4>← Rewind</h4><p>Read backward</p><ul><li>Restore Position</li><li>Restore Sprite</li></ul></div>
    <div class="sequence"><p class="label">ONE RECORDED SEQUENCE</p><div class="states">{['t₀', 't₁', 't₂'].map((t, i) => <div class="state" data-connect={i < 2 ? 'true' : undefined}><strong>{t}</strong><span>Position</span><span>Velocity</span><span>Sprite</span></div>)}</div><div class="read-directions"><p>Rewind: t₂ → t₁ → t₀</p><p>Replay: t₀ → t₁ → t₂</p></div></div>
    <div class="use replay"><h4>Replay →</h4><p>Read forward</p><ul><li>Apply Velocity to Rigidbody2D</li><li>Unity physics handles current collisions</li></ul></div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>The same states support two behaviors; the linked list is their storage.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
.record-flow{margin:28px 0 24px;padding:26px;background:#e8e9df;border:1px solid #c8ceba}.flow-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.65fr 1fr;gap:28px;align-items:center}.label,.time{font:11px monospace;letter-spacing:.06em;color:#6c745e;margin:0 0 14px}.states{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px}.state{position:relative;border:1px solid #a7b18d;background:#f3f1eb;padding:13px 10px}.state strong{display:block;color:#52603e;font:18px monospace;margin-bottom:12px}.state span{display:block;font:12px monospace;line-height:1.9;color:#4f5647}.time{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin:12px 0 0}.use h4{font-size:23px;font-weight:400;color:#4f603c;margin:0 0 12px;letter-spacing:-.02em}.use p{font-size:14px;color:#69715d;margin:0 0 10px}.use ul{padding-left:17px;margin:0;color:#50594a;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}.replay{border-left:2px solid #a0b3a4;padding-left:20px}.rewind{border-right:2px solid #a9b38a;padding-right:20px}figcaption{font-size:12px;color:#747b6c;line-height:1.6;margin-top:22px}@media(max-width:750px){.flow-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px}.sequence{grid-column:1/-1;grid-row:1}.record-flow{padding:20px}.use h4{font-size:20px}.use ul{font-size:13px}.state span{font-size:11px}.replay{padding-left:14px}.rewind{border:0;padding:0}}
.state[data-connect]::after{content:'⇄';position:absolute;right:-21px;top:45%;font:19px monospace;color:#677455}.read-directions{margin-top:14px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.read-directions p{font:12px monospace;color:#52603e;line-height:1.7;margin:0}.read-directions p:last-child{text-align:left;color:#416655}@media(max-width:750px){.states{gap:17px}.state{padding:12px 6px}.state[data-connect]::after{right:-16px;font-size:15px}.read-directions{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:4px}.read-directions p{font-size:11px}}
</style>
